# StenoDesk Cloudflare Pages redirects
# https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/

# 1. WWW -> apex (canonical domain) — 301 permanent
https://www.stenodesk.co/* https://stenodesk.co/:splat 301!

# 2. SPA fallback: known client routes serve the SPA (spa.html = build copy of
#    index.html; proxying to /index.html directly triggers CF's automatic
#    /index.html -> / 308 canonicalization). Per-route rules only — NOT a
#    blanket /* rewrite — so genuinely unknown paths fall through to 404.html.
/login /spa 200
/login/ /spa 200
/signup /spa 200
/signup/ /spa 200
/forgot-password /spa 200
/forgot-password/ /spa 200
/reset-password /spa 200
/reset-password/ /spa 200
/app/* /spa 200
/portal/* /spa 200

# 3. NOTE: cross-host www->apex redirect lives at the ZONE level (Page Rule
#    37503f834d7cf5310daa793de118f334) — Pages _redirects cannot match a
#    different host than the deployment (verified empirically 2026-09-07).

# 4. Microtools: legacy .html URLs -> extensionless (301 permanent)
/microtools/index.html /microtools/ 301
/microtools/invoice-calculator.html /microtools/invoice-calculator 301
/microtools/page-count-estimator.html /microtools/page-count-estimator 301
/microtools/mileage-calculator.html /microtools/mileage-calculator 301
/microtools/expedite-calculator.html /microtools/expedite-calculator 301
/microtools/tax-setaside-calculator.html /microtools/tax-setaside-calculator 301
